  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICMPS - ARAMBA DEVELOPMENT FOUNDATION INC V039 CANBERRA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Aramba Development Inc have partnered with the Trukai Rice Industry last year 2023 to distribute rice grains to farmers and conduct rice farming training. Farmers have started farming rice early last however, they couldn&#x2019;t mill the rice due to lack of Rice Mills in the area as it is very expensive to purchase one compounded with logistical challenges to ship Rice Mills from the capital city of Port Moresby to the project site in Western Province.Hence, this project proposal is an intervention to purchase 5x potable Rice Mills to assist local rice farmers to mill rice in order to address food security and livelihood.</narrative>
  </description>
